1479: a tie of six accidentals goes to sharps (F♯, D♯m: a C♭ of the signature is sung C), the other spelling named beside it; a score in an unusual spelling of the key asked is spelled again, not moved.
1480: Full with a key chosen and no score plans the score alone, moves it to the key and sings it, in one press.
1481: the Librarian opens an import in the 🚨 IMPORTED workspace the lab puts it in.
1482: the run's cancel button and its question's yes say «Cancel it».
1483: Make again, Edit, Refiner and the card's files under Download in the take's menu, each pressing the card's own button on that take.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
